---
description: Binding Missa design-system and component-selection instructions
globs: apps/web/**/*.{ts,tsx,css}
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow `AGENTS.md`. Before changing UI, read `DESIGN.md`,
`apps/web/component-policy.json`, `apps/web/component-catalogue.json`, and
`docs/ai-ui-build-directive.md`. Select primitives and semantic components by
intent through the policy, preserve Missa tokens and accessibility behavior,
and run `npm run check:design-system` before handoff. For repeatable workflows
use `.github/skills/missa-component-docs`, `.github/skills/missa-token-mapping`,
and `.github/skills/missa-design-review`; they follow the source precedence in
`.github/skills/README.md`.
